          "Don't buy through your own tax-season exhaustion. If your enrolled agents are already on extended hours doing client work, paid transfers will land on the worst version of your team. Lower concurrency. Shift to CPL. Or wait. Paying for qualified calls your team is too tired to enroll is a self-own.",
